{"4678540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marshland Hollow", "steam_appid": 4678540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4963860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An adventure game where exploration and atmosphere takes priority over puzzle-solving.  A cozy dose of gentle gothic spookiness...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things are not the same...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like the islands of the Marshlands have lost their mystery to Wolfram. He used to feel so inspired, writing about the supernatural corners of the Marshlands. Now every word rings hollow...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca812b4953c8bc3bca82f2f238049f8c.poster.avif?t=1788351818\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca812b4953c8bc3bca82f2f238049f8c.webm?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca812b4953c8bc3bca82f2f238049f8c.mp4?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Marshlands...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolfram drifts through the islands, slowly piecing together the fragments of his long-delayed book...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca4be48c2f07f5cee8aac70e0081198a.poster.avif?t=1788351818\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca4be48c2f07f5cee8aac70e0081198a.webm?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca4be48c2f07f5cee8aac70e0081198a.mp4?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy days - spooky nights...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Wolfram, days and nights have began to lose their meaning. When life feels too glum, he gets into bed and awaits whatever comes next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/cddef748350512601fe51aeba7304e0b.poster.avif?t=1788351818\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/cddef748350512601fe51aeba7304e0b.webm?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/cddef748350512601fe51aeba7304e0b.mp4?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At a glance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story‑first design</strong> with atmosphere taking priority over puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, short, and fluent dialogue</strong> that keeps the pace flowing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point‑and‑click exploration</strong> across cozy-yet-spooky isometric landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue and choices</strong> gently steers the story onwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic scenery </strong>with visuals and music that change between day and night</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An adventure game where exploration and atmosphere takes priority over puzzle-solving.  A cozy dose of gentle gothic spookiness...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things are not the same...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like the islands of the Marshlands have lost their mystery to Wolfram. He used to feel so inspired, writing about the supernatural corners of the Marshlands. Now every word rings hollow...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca812b4953c8bc3bca82f2f238049f8c.poster.avif?t=1788351818\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca812b4953c8bc3bca82f2f238049f8c.webm?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca812b4953c8bc3bca82f2f238049f8c.mp4?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Marshlands...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolfram drifts through the islands, slowly piecing together the fragments of his long-delayed book...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca4be48c2f07f5cee8aac70e0081198a.poster.avif?t=1788351818\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca4be48c2f07f5cee8aac70e0081198a.webm?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/ca4be48c2f07f5cee8aac70e0081198a.mp4?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy days - spooky nights...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Wolfram, days and nights have began to lose their meaning. When life feels too glum, he gets into bed and awaits whatever comes next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/cddef748350512601fe51aeba7304e0b.poster.avif?t=1788351818\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/cddef748350512601fe51aeba7304e0b.webm?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/extras/cddef748350512601fe51aeba7304e0b.mp4?t=1788351818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At a glance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story‑first design</strong> with atmosphere taking priority over puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, short, and fluent dialogue</strong> that keeps the pace flowing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point‑and‑click exploration</strong> across cozy-yet-spooky isometric landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue and choices</strong> gently steers the story onwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic scenery </strong>with visuals and music that change between day and night</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A story‑driven experience about an author of the supernatural, wandering the Marshlands in search of the fragments that will shape his long‑delayed book. He used to feel so inspired, but now every word rings hollow... A cozy little adventure steeped in gentle gothic spookiness.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/9f4471bc0b636c65f89948cfa5416690c2675c57/header.jpg?t=1788351818", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678540/03ef312b95c7692891ea5ecfe481b22cab62d785/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17883